# Reference material fetched at development time, never vendored (ADR-0005).
# Jellyfin source, the pinned OpenAPI document, differential reports.
/reference/

# Credentials for the differential harness and the probes, which are pointed at
# this server over HTTP (conformance.md, L3). Never committed; .env.example is
# the tracked template.
/.env
/.env.local

# A binary built in the working tree by `go build ./cmd/atrium`. The name is the
# command's, so it is the one file a plain build leaves behind.
/atrium
